Arithmetic
-----------
add | Adds two numbers | add(5, 3) → 8
subtract | Subtracts second number from first | subtract(10, 4) → 6
equals(number) | Checks if numbers are equal | equals(5, 5) → true
absolute | Returns absolute value | absolute(-7) → 7
sqrt | Square root of a number | sqrt(16) → 4
square | Square of a number | square(5) → 25
sign | Returns 1 (positive), -1 (negative), or 0 | sign(-9) → -1
neg | Negates a number | neg(6) → -6
inv | Inverse of a number | inv(2) → 0.5
power | Exponential power | power(2, 3) → 8
multiply | Multiplies two numbers | multiply(4, 5) → 20
divide | Divides first by second | divide(10, 2) → 5
max | Maximum of two numbers | max(3, 7) → 7
min | Minimum of two numbers | min(3, 7) → 3
ceil | Rounds up | ceil(4.2) → 5
round | Normal round | round(4.6) → 5
counter | Returns position in iteration | counter() → 1, 2, 3…
formatNumber | Formats number with pattern | formatNumber(1234.567, "#.00") → 1234.57

Boolean ->
----------
and | Logical AND | and(true, false) → false
or | Logical OR | or(true, false) → true
not | Logical NOT | not(true) → false
equals(boolean) | Boolean equality | equals(true, true) → true
notEquals | Opposite of equals | notEquals(true, false) → true
if | If-else logic | if(true, "yes", "no") → yes
its | Returns second param if condition is true | its(true, "value") → value
ifWithoutElse | If logic without else | ifWithoutElse(false, "ok") → null
ifsWithoutElse | Multiple ifs | ifsWithoutElse(true, "A", false, "B") → A
isNil | Checks if value is null or empty | isNil("") → true

Constant ->
-------------
constant | Fixed constant value | constant("SAP") → SAP
copyValue | Copies existing value | copyValue(Input1) → Input1
xsi:nil | Marks value as nil/null | xsi:nil() → nil

Conversions
-----------
fixValue | Replace value based on condition | fixValue("M", "Male", "F", "Female")
valueMapping | Uses external value mapping table | valueMapping("Gender", "M") → Male

Data (Date/Time)
----------------
currentDate | Current date/time | currentDate() → 2025-04-16T12:00
dateTrans | Convert date formats | dateTrans("16-04-2025", "dd-MM-yyyy", "yyyy/MM/dd") → 2025/04/16
dateBefore | Is date1 before date2? | dateBefore("2024-01-01", "2025-01-01") → true
dateAfter | Is date1 after date2? | dateAfter("2025-01-01", "2024-01-01") → true
compareDates | Compare two dates | compareDates("2024-01-01", "2025-01-01") → -1

Node Functions
---------------
exists | Checks if node exists | exists(/root/name) → true
getHeader | Get header value | getHeader("Content-Type") → application/json
getProperty | Get property value | getProperty("Country") → IN
splitByValue | Split array by value | splitByValue(List, "Tag")
collapseContext | Remove context levels | Use after splitByValue()
useOneAsMany | Repeats a value for mapping | Useful in 1:n mappings
sort | Sorts values | sort(List)
sortByKey | Sort by a key value | sortByKey(List, "ID")
mapWithDefault | Map with fallback | mapWithDefault(Input, "default")
formatByExample | Format as per example | formatByExample("12345", "XXXXX-XX") → 12345--

Statistic
----------
sum | Adds values | sum(List) → 100
average | Mean of values | average(List) → 20
count | Count of items | count(List) → 5
index | Returns index of item | index() → 0, 1, 2...

Text
----
subString | Substring from string | subString("Hello", 1, 3) → ell
concat | Joins strings | concat("SAP", "CPI") → SAPCPI
equals(String) | Compare strings | equals("A", "a") → false
indexOf(2) | Position of string | indexOf("hello", "l") → 2
indexOf(3) | With start index | indexOf("hello", "l", 3) → 3
lastIndexOf(2) | Last index of char | lastIndexOf("hello", "l") → 3
lastIndexOf(3) | With start index | lastIndexOf("hello", "l", 2) → 2
compare | Compare strings | compare("A", "B") → -1
replaceString | Replace text | replaceString("hello", "l", "x") → hexxo
length | String length | length("SAP") → 3
endWith(2) | Ends with check | endWith("data.xml", ".xml") → true
startWith(2) | Starts with check | startWith("SAP CPI", "SAP") → true
startWith(3) | Starts with + ignore case | startWith("SAP", "sap", true) → true
toUpperCase | Convert to upper | toUpperCase("sap") → SAP
trim | Trim spaces | trim("  hello ") → hello
toLowerCase | Convert to lower | toLowerCase("SAP") → sap



